WEBVTT

00:09:58.792 --> 00:10:01.292
the creator of the "Star Wars" movies.

00:10:02.375 --> 00:10:05.018
Why a building that looks like a cloud?

00:10:05.042 --> 00:10:10.226
Because I think, I imagine,
the cloud is mysterious.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:11.833
It's nature.

00:10:12.875 --> 00:10:18.518
It's surreal when this natural element
landed in the city.

00:10:18.542 --> 00:10:21.684
And it makes you feel curious about it,

00:10:21.708 --> 00:10:24.250
and you want to explore it.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:30.059
So that's how the building
landed on earth.